## 6.7 의존성 관리

### 6.7.1 Project.toml (패키지 메타데이터)

```toml
[package]
name = "MyPackage"
version = "0.1.0"

[deps]
Plots = "91a5bcdd-55d7-5caf-9e0b-520d859cae80"
DataFrames = "a93c6f00-e57d-5684-b7b6-d8193f3e46c0"

[compat]
Plots = "1.0"
DataFrames = "1.0"
```

